  "bodyHash": "cf56a5adba0786fd",
  "content": "<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"781078843056368612220679\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FszWTIQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"420\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Relics 是一款易于安装的拖拽式模组，添加了数十种具有复杂且深思熟虑机制的独特物品。每件遗物的真正潜力既可以在单独使用时解锁，也可以与其他遗物甚至其他模组组合时解锁。在创建每个遗物时，我们考虑到模组包不会仅包含我们的模组，因此模组的平衡性会自动调整以适应模组包的需求，这使得 Relics 既能完美融入类原版风格的模组包，也能适应那些生命值和伤害数值高达数千的模组包。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5sPMQuK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"386\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">《我的世界》并非无尽，迟早所有游戏内容都会结束，玩家必须自娱自乐。我们考虑到了这一点，并努力让 Relics 的体验尽可能长久有趣。得益于我们的升级系统和随机属性，每个遗物都不会千篇一律。玩家可以自由选择他们想要的遗物效果，生成 virtually 无限数量的遗物组合。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/339/2023-04-21_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"232\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">安装此模组后，你将获得：</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 28 个拥有独特且复杂机制的遗物。全部收集吧！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 类似大型多人在线游戏的随机属性系统。寻找最佳遗物，或者亲手重新打造它们！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 遗物的改进与自定义功能。创造你自己的无敌组合！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 渐进式主动技能系统。展示你所有的微操技巧！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"918249872476659861259619\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYHFXh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">SSKirillSS - 经理，开发者</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: sskirillss</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Telegram: @SSKirillSS</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">julewernvvp - 艺术家</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: julewern</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sketchfab: <a href=\"https://sketchfab.com/julewernvvp\">链接</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Vebste - 测试员</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: vebste.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"084308688994070370956414\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2x3ogo6.png\" width=\"181\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：关于移植到 Fabric/Quilt 平台呢？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：目前暂无移植计划。但如果 Relics 进入</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-quot\">“完成”</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">阶段，且我没有失去兴趣的话，未来仍有可能移植。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：关于移植到其他版本的 MC 呢？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：每次移植到新版本的 MC 都伴随着 Relics 的重大更新，因为这通常涉及对模组的基础性更改。一旦当前更新的所有内容向公众发布，我就会开始移植到更高版本的游戏。至于旧版本——不会，不会有反向移植。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：你能添加一本指南书之类的东西吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：我不喜欢指南书的概念。所以，不，目前没有计划。但你可以自己在你的模组包中添加它，或者如果你愿意，可以制作一个公共维基。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：较新 MC 版本中的 Relics 内容会被移植到旧版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不会。新内容将仅添加到 Relics 正在支持的最新版 MC 中。其他所有版本处于</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-ldquo\">“仅修复错误”</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">状态。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以为 Relics 制作插件（addons）吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：可以，但是……我现在不建议这样做。只是因为 Relics 的 API 仍然不稳定且变化频繁。最好的解决方案是等待情况稳定下来。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以创建你模组的公共分支/遗留版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不行，你不能。但如果是为了</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-lparen\">私人</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">用途（我指的是和朋友一起玩之类的事情，而不发布到 CurseForge 或其他资源网站）——那你可以这样做。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以在模组包中使用你的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：是的，如果你想用就可以用。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以把模组重新上传到其他网站吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：不行，你不能。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以参考你的代码来开发我的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：尽管模组的许可证是 ARR，但你仍然可以将 Relics 的代码作为参考。但是，请不要只是简单地执行 Ctrl+C → Ctrl+V（直接复制粘贴）。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">还有问题？- <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\"><strong>访问我们的 Discord！</strong></a></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>模组描述仅适用于 MC 1.19.2 及更高版本！</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
